---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
const phone = '+13025550147';
const phoneDisplay = '(302) 555-0147';
---
<Layout title="Strange Noises from AC | AC Repair Middletown DE" description="Strange AC noises in Middletown, DE. Diagnose grinding, squealing, and rattling before bigger failures.">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>Strange Noises from AC</h1>
      <p>Address Soon · Middletown, DE</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container content-block">
      <p>Grinding, squealing, rattling, or banging from the outdoor or indoor unit often points to a failing motor bearing, loose fan blade, or worn belt.</p>
      <p>Early attention prevents motor failure and more expensive repairs.</p>
      <h2>Get Help Today</h2>
      <p>Call <a href={`tel:${phone}`} style="color:var(--primary);font-weight:600">{phoneDisplay}</a> for same-day service in Middletown and New Castle County. Upfront pricing, licensed technicians, written estimate before work begins.</p>
      <p style="margin-top:1.5rem">
        <a href={`tel:${phone}`} class="btn btn-primary">Call {phoneDisplay}</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
